WEBVTT

00:12:59.933 --> 00:13:02.489
muathirika, mbakaji --

00:13:02.513 --> 00:13:04.768
na majina yanayotumika kuapanga dhana,

00:13:04.792 --> 00:13:09.174
lakini wanaweza pia huvua utu katika vidokezo yanavyomaanisha.

00:13:09.838 --> 00:13:11.938
Mtu anapoonyeshwa kama muathirika,

00:13:11.962 --> 00:13:17.195
ni rahisi sana kumpuuza kama bidhaa mbovu,

00:13:17.219 --> 00:13:18.725
fedheha,

00:13:18.749 --> 00:13:20.024
isiyo na thamani.

00:13:20.643 --> 00:13:23.363
Na vivyo hivyo, mara moja mtu
anapoitwa mbakaji,

00:13:23.387 --> 00:13:25.933
ni rahisi zaidi kumuita zimwi -

00:13:26.576 --> 00:13:27.875
mnyama.

00:13:28.614 --> 00:13:31.645
Lakini ni jinsi gani tutaelewa
nini katika jamii